lvina's normal attack becomes Whirl Assault for the first 12s of battle. Each Whirl Assault deals 140% + 10% ATK damage. Defeating the marked enemy prolongs the Whirl Assault duration by 6 + 2s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":68,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":190,"end":194,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击造成的伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Each Whirl Assault deals 150% + 10% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击造成的伤害提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Each Whirl Assault deals 160% + 10% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击造成的伤害提升至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Each Whirl Assault deals 170% + 10% ATK damage."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Crit during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升24点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 24 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升32点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 32 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Crit by 40 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","秘光之盾"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Shield of Light"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，获得一个护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Gains a shield at the start of a battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“先发制人”释放后，自身获得一个抵御450% ATK伤害的护盾。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Silvina gains a shield that can block up to 450% ATK damage after casting First Strike."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases shield value to 500% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“疾影旋击”持续期间，若标记的敌人被击败，该敌人附近2格范围内的敌人受到4秒恐惧效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When a marked enemy is defeated, Silvina frightens enemies within 2 tiles of the defeated enemy for 4s while Blade Vortex is in effect."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾的抵御值提升至600% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases shield value to 600% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击还能降低目标受愈。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Silvina reduces the target's Vitality with each Whirl Assault."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次回旋击还能在3秒内降低目标60点受愈。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Silvina also reduces the target's Vitality by 60 for 3s with each Whirl Assault."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“先发制人”造成的伤害额外提升250% ATK，释放“疾影旋击”期间，获得50点攻击速度。对“先发制人”目标的普攻还会附带其已损生命值12%的伤害，额外伤害部分不超过240% ATK。若和伊莎贝拉一同上阵，自身获得“秘光之盾”时，还会为伊莎贝拉提供等量护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Silvina increases First Strike's damage dealt by 250% ATK. While Blade Vortex is active, she gains 50 ATK SPD. Her normal attacks against the enemy marked by First Strike also deal extra damage equal to 12% of the target's lost HP. The extra damage cannot exceed 240% ATK.\nIf an allied Isabella is deployed, whenever Silvina gains a shield from Shield of Light, she also grants Isabella a shield of equal value."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":263,"end":271,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","恶毒双刃"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Wicked Sisters"]]}